From 0462b0dd11b26736f372e414fefc6a4e270868a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jun Zhang <jun.zhang@arm.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Aug 2023 16:18:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add mhu v3 driver for se_proxy SP

The driver for MHU V3 is based on the implementation in
trusted-firmware-m [0]. Add a build parameter to select
the version of MHU and the default version is MHU V2.
If we use MHU V3, then the parameter as below is needed.

-DPLAT_MHU_VERSION=3

0:
platform/ext/target/arm/rss/common/native_drivers/mhu_v3_x.c
platform/ext/target/arm/rss/common/native_drivers/mhu_v3_x.h
platform/ext/target/arm/rss/common/native_drivers/mhu_wrapper_v3_x.c

Repo: https://gitlab.arm.com/infra-solutions/reference-design/platsw/trusted-firmware-m/
Tag: RD-INFRA-2023.06.28

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Jun Zhang <jun.zhang@arm.com>
---
 .../drivers/arm/mhu_driver/component.cmake    |  18 +-
 platform/drivers/arm/mhu_driver/mhu.h         | 107 +++
 platform/drivers/arm/mhu_driver/mhu_v3_x.c    | 646 ++++++++++++++++++
 platform/drivers/arm/mhu_driver/mhu_v3_x.h    | 259 +++++++
 .../drivers/arm/mhu_driver/mhu_wrapper_v3_x.c | 308 +++++++++
 5 files changed, 1333 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 platform/drivers/arm/mhu_driver/mhu.h
 create mode 100644 platform/drivers/arm/mhu_driver/mhu_v3_x.c
 create mode 100644 platform/drivers/arm/mhu_driver/mhu_v3_x.h
 create mode 100644 platform/drivers/arm/mhu_driver/mhu_wrapper_v3_x.c

